  "zh": "# 英伟达黄仁勋复任、神舟二十四号首载外籍航天员、纽约禁车费等八大热点\n## AI 与算力\n- **英伟达黄仁勋复任CEO**：董事会11天内全票请回，显示AI芯片霸主内部权力斗争暂时落幕。\n- **AMD EPYC Zen 6性能跃升**：十年迭代实现几何平均12.1倍提升，服务器算力跃升重塑云端竞争格局。\n## 前沿理论与材料\n- **Anthropic宣称VP不等于VNP**：若成立将颠覆计算复杂性基石，引发学界激烈争论与后续验证热潮。\n- **新型材料越弯越强**：华盛顿大学研发拓扑机械材料，弯曲时强度反增，或推动柔性电子与机器人新应用。\n## 航天与政策\n- **神舟二十四号搭载巴基斯坦航天员**：中国空间站迎首位外籍航天员，标志国际合作迈入常态化新阶段。\n- **纽约州禁汽车订阅附加费**：首个州级立法限制车企变相收费，直接保护消费者钱包并倒逼行业定价透明。\n## 民生与消费\n- **一老一小新政托幼养老**：中央文件推动幼儿园招两岁童、养老服务扩容，直击家庭托育与养老双重痛点。\n- **华为Mate X8折叠屏发布**：搭载鸿蒙新架构与自研铰链，折叠屏从概念走向实用化，重塑高端手机形态。",
  "en": "# Nvidia CEO returns, Shenzhou 24 flies Pakistani astronaut, NY bans car fees, plus five more top stories\n## AI & Compute\n- **Nvidia Jensen Huang Reinstated CEO**: The board’s unanimous recall in just 11 days shows the power struggle at the AI chip leader has temporarily settled.\n- **AMD EPYC Zen 6 Performance Leap**: A 12.1× geometric‑mean gain over a decade reshapes server compute competition.\n## Frontier Theory & Materials\n- **Anthropic Claims VP Not Equal VNP**: If proven, it would upend a cornerstone of computational complexity, sparking intense academic debate.\n- **New Material Gets Stronger When Bent**: Washington University’s topological metamaterial gains strength when bent, opening doors for flexible electronics and robotics.\n## Space & Policy\n- **Shenzhou 24 Carries Pakistani Astronaut**: China’s space station welcomes its first foreign astronaut, marking a new era of routine international cooperation.\n- **New York Bans Car Subscription Fees**: The first state law curbing hidden car subscription fees directly protects consumers and forces pricing transparency.\n## Livelihood & Consumer\n- **China One Old One Young Policy Expands Childcare Elderly Care**: Beijing’s directive to enroll two‑year‑olds in kindergartens and expand eldercare tackles families’ twin care burdens.\n- **Huawei Mate X8 Foldable Launch**: With a new HarmonyOS architecture and proprietary hinge, the Mate X8 pushes foldables from concept to practical flagship."
